From: Tom Scanlan <tompscanlan@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:43:08 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] network: a host page can point PDSls at another atproto
 network

globalThis.PDSLS_NETWORK, set before the app loads, gives the PLC directory,
DNS-over-HTTPS resolver, a fixed lexicon authority, the Bluesky API, Constellation,
the stream instances, and whether to sign in with client metadata at the page's
own origin. Unset, every address is the public network's, as before. null turns a
feature off, so a private network falls back to no public service.
